Wed Mar 11 17:02:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 0.9.4:
  Added
  * --no-mdns flag (#41) — xfr serve --no-mdns disables mDNS
    service registration for environments where multicast is
    unwanted or another service already uses mDNS.
  * server.no_mdns config support — also configurable via [server]
    no_mdns = true in ~/.config/xfr/config.toml.
  Changed
  * Delta retransmits in interval reports (#36) — plain text
    interval lines now show per-interval retransmit deltas instead
    of cumulative totals, making it easier to spot when retransmits
    actually occur. Hidden intervals from --omit, --quiet, or
    larger --interval settings no longer get folded into the next
    visible rtx: value. Final summary still shows cumulative totals

